&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:22.5pt;"&gt;(企業結合等関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesBusinessCombinationsFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRevenueRecognitionFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:22.5pt;"&gt;(収益認識関係)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;顧客との契約から生じる収益を理解するための基礎となる情報は、（重要な会計方針）「７．重要な収益認識の計上基準」に記載のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRevenueRecognitionFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantEventsAfterReportingPeriodFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:22.5pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;(重要な後発事象)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:15pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:7.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantEventsAfterReportingPeriodFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
